case three additional replicas of that same data will be kept also across separate fault domains in the paired 
region within the same geography. Examples of Azure Regions are North and South US or North and West 
Europe. These regions are separated by several hundred miles. Geo-replication provides additional data 
durability in case of a region wide disaster. For Azure Government, the geo-replication is limited to regions 
